1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,000
Some dreams are not built by one pair of hands alone.

2
00:00:05,000 --> 00:00:10,000
But my dream began with my mother.

3
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:16,000
When I was little, I loved drawing houses.

4
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:23,000
She couldn't give me everything I wished for, but she shared what she had.

5
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:29,000
She always encouraged me not to give up.
(Don't give up on it, my daughter. Try again.)

6
00:00:29,000 --> 00:00:35,000
Through little everyday things, she showed me how much she cared.

7
00:00:35,000 --> 00:00:41,000
Years passed, and I grew up.

8
00:00:41,000 --> 00:00:48,000
But the journey wasn't easy. Sometimes, I doubted myself.

9
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:54,000
I received a voice message from my mother.
(My daughter, don't rush. Believe in yourself. Finish what you started.)

10
00:00:54,000 --> 00:01:00,000
Her words gave me strength. I tried again.

11
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:08,000
Then I understood. This dream was never mine alone. My mother had helped build it with me.

